finding = 'All four exact immutable lease expiry strings already match the unchanged I1 moment +00:00/6-or-7-fraction predicate. The proposed expiry callsite does not reproduce the historical +03 offset incompatibility. A different actual timestamp consumer must be identified and reviewed, or this must be explicitly respecified as optional future format broadening without claiming an actual expiry repair. No implementation authority is supplied by this refusal.'
